OL,3,GNEWSA'I can't get a permit to park
OL,4,Aoutside my home'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA pensioner who has parked outside his
OL,7,Fhouse for eight years says he has been
OL,8,Frefused a permit to keep doing so,
OL,9,Fdespite applying for one almost 150
OL,10,Ftimes.
OL,12,FJack Wallbank, 75, said he had
OL,13,Finitially welcomed the controlled
OL,14,Fparking zone (CPZ) when it was
OL,15,Fintroduced at the start of the year in
OL,16,FCleethorpes, North East Lincolnshire,
OL,17,Fbut he was declined a permit due to his
OL,18,Fhome not being on the list of eligible
OL,19,Faddresses.
OL,23,APub: 17-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
